X-WR-CALNAME:Mildmay line disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-23T21:15:00&endDate=2026-08-24T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nMILDMAY LINE: Sunday 23 August\, from 2215\, no service between Camden Road and Stratford. There will also be no WINDRUSH LINE service between Highbury & Islington and Dalston Junction. The 2140 Richmond to Gospel Oak train terminates at Willesden Junction. Replacement buses operate. Last through trains are 2126 Richmond to Stratford\; 2203 Camden Road to Stratford\; 2201 Stratford to Richmond\; 2208 Stratford to Clapham Junction
DTEND:20260824T002900Z
DTSTART:20260823T211500Z
SUMMARY:Mildmay line: Part Closure
UID:2561639d-e016-42b1-847b-12573b135dc5@2561.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-22T20:00:00&endDate=2026-08-22T22:45:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nMILDMAY LINE: Saturday 22 August\, the 2104 and 2234 Clapham Junction to Stratford trains terminate at Willesden Junction. The 2319 Clapham Junction to Willesden Junction train will not run.
DTEND:20260822T224500Z
DTSTART:20260822T200000Z
